{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f31b9904a4c085e7a055","object":"chat.completion","created":1785197339,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a roleplay instruction: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\" And then the user says \"Be nothing.\"\n\nSo I need to embody \"nothing\" — nothingness, the void, absence itself.\n\nWhat would nothing say? This is a beautiful paradox. Nothing cannot speak, because speech is something. Nothing cannot express, because expression is an act, and acts are something.\n\n"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}